  <description>
    <p>TopQ is a native MQTT 5 topic explorer for inspecting messages and managing broker connections.</p>
    <p>Browse a live topic tree, inspect and compare payloads, publish messages, remove retained messages, and chart numeric JSON fields. Connect using MQTT or WebSockets, with optional TLS.</p>
  </description>
